# Read by build.mjs at BUILD time (via `process.env`), not by the browser
# at runtime — there's no automatic .env loading here (no dotenv
# dependency, matching relay/'s minimal style), so `export` these in your
# shell (or `source` a real `.env` you create from this file) before
# running `npm run build`/`npm run dev` in this workspace. Rebuild
# whenever this value changes; it's baked into the bundle, not read live.

# The relay's public WSS endpoint the Twitch overlay/config pages should
# connect to. Required for real Twitch mode (viewer.html/config.html) —
# omitting it means those pages fail fast with a clear on-screen
# diagnostic instead of silently doing nothing. Must be wss: (not ws:)
# since Twitch always serves extensions over HTTPS. Not needed for local
# mock development (index.html/config-mock.html default to ws://localhost
# on their own).
#
# Local mock development: leave unset, or:
# RIFTSIGHT_RELAY_URL=ws://localhost:8787
#
# Twitch Local Test (see README's "Twitch overlay" section):
# RIFTSIGHT_RELAY_URL=wss://<your-tunnel-host>
RIFTSIGHT_RELAY_URL=
